events.announce:
@sound beep
[KIT] STICKY.TXT is a hidden file: DIR skips it, DIR /A shows it.
[KIT] Reading it fired an event, which is how this message appeared.

@sound chirp
*** 1 NEW MESSAGE ***
[KIT] Logging in as CHEN fired an event, and the event delivered new mail. Type MAIL.

@wait 600
@glitch 600
[KIT] That file could only be opened by CHEN, and it self-destructed after one read.
[KIT] In the GM workspace, Reset session brings it back.

[KIT] OVERRIDE asked a question (@ask), deleted CAMERA.LOG (@delete),
[KIT] revealed a hidden manual (@reveal) and fired this event (@trigger).
@wait 2500
@theme Red alert
@sound klaxon
@flash red
@shake 900
*** REACTOR OVERLOAD ***
@speak Warning. Reactor overload. Enter the emergency shutdown code.
@countdown 90 Meltdown | REACTOR
[KIT] A countdown is running. The code is somewhere on this drive. Try FIND SHUTDOWN.

@stop
@theme default
@sound powerdown
REACTOR SHUTDOWN COMPLETE.
@sound success
@slow Kestrel Station is safe. Well done, engineer.

[KIT] Typing the exact phrase SHUTDOWN 4471 fired this ending. A custom command
[KIT] named SHUTDOWN answers every wrong code.
[KIT] That is the whole showcase. Type GMMODE to see how it was built.
@end

@sound static
@glitch 2000
@sound powerdown
@clear
@wait 1500
REACTOR MELTDOWN. KESTREL STATION LOST.

[KIT] The countdown ran out and fired this ending. To try again, type GMMODE
[KIT] and click Reset session.
@end

@sound alert
[KIT] This hint fired by itself after 4 minutes of play (a timer event).
[KIT] Stuck? Try CD PUBLIC, then DIR /A.

e5qrwhv.content:
KESTREL STATION OVERRIDE v2.1
@sound modem
CONNECTING TO MAINFRAME...
@progress BYPASSING FIREWALL
@ask UNLOCK ALL DOORS? (Y/N)
@if YES, Y
@sound success
SECURITY OVERRIDE ACCEPTED.
@delete SECURITY\CAMERA.LOG
@reveal SECURITY\MANUAL.TXT
@trigger Doors unlocked
@else
OVERRIDE CANCELLED. RUN OVERRIDE AGAIN WHEN YOU ARE READY.
@endif

